# Layout

The create-next-app tree currently uses root `app/`. New fullstack code should grow toward:

```
src/
  app/                 # routes; _components/ colocated per route
  server/
    actions/           # Server Actions by domain
    db/client.ts
    db/schema.ts
    services/          # framework-agnostic logic
    auth.ts
  lib/                 # Zod schemas, constants, utils
  components/          # shared UI
  types/
```

Prefer native Next.js (Server Actions, RSC, `revalidatePath`/`revalidateTag`) over new libraries unless native cannot do the job.

Do **not** follow `docs/architecture.md` Route Handler + TanStack Query defaults; that doc is superseded by these rules.
